{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/671315-kismet-s-changeling-contracts-revamp-part-i","id":671315,"title":"Kismet's Changeling Contracts Revamp Part I","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-19T14:21:01-07:00","id":671315,"title":"Kismet's Changeling Contracts Revamp Part I","content":"<span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I just finished the first phase of reworking some Changeling Contracts that have nagged at us for years. I'm editing them for our group and our purposes, but I'd appreciate having other eyes looking it over. You just never know what you might have missed or failed to think of.<br /> <br /> Feel free to leave <b><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/180g0MeiyB3IwP9Pf1O-IRUAXtpMC19bqX7XRgRNhamA/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">any constructive feedback you have in the GoogleDoc itself</a></b> or here on this thread. I tried to include the reasons behind the changes in the far right column, for anyone who's interested. Thank you for checking it out! </span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kismet's <a href=\"http://www.wod.kismetrose.com/\" target=\"_blank\">WOD</a> - <a href=\"http://www.dnd.kismetrose.com/\" target=\"_blank\">D&amp;D</a> - <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/BoundinDreams\" target=\"_blank\">C:tL</a> - <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheNamelessEmpire\" target=\"_blank\">M:tC</a></b>","edited":{"userid":227,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/227-kismetrose","user":"KismetRose","date":". 09-20-2015, 12:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/227-kismetrose","name":"KismetRose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-21T13:51:34-07:00","id":673409,"title":"","content":"Looks good.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-21T21:26:13-07:00","id":673847,"title":"","content":"Thank you for taking a look! I've been on a real Changeling kick the last few days, and it helps to have another set of eyes looking for glaring problems. =)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kismet's <a href=\"http://www.wod.kismetrose.com/\" target=\"_blank\">WOD</a> - <a href=\"http://www.dnd.kismetrose.com/\" target=\"_blank\">D&amp;D</a> - <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/BoundinDreams\" target=\"_blank\">C:tL</a> - <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheNamelessEmpire\" target=\"_blank\">M:tC</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/227-kismetrose","name":"KismetRose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-27T21:44:16-07:00","id":680667,"title":"","content":"Hey, it's Kismet! I really like all that homebrew you wrote and compiled on your site.<br /> <br /> I don't see any significant flaws right now. I did notice how the dice pool for Contracts in this case is Attribute + Skill + dot rating of the Contract or Mantle. This falls in line with the Disciplines and Gifts as written in 2ED. It does make me wonder what powers or inherent advantages of the template will use Wyrd in the dice pool. This also makes the dice pools of changelings more variable, but I don't know if that is good or bad yet.<br /> <br /> Of note is how the Contracts' effects are determined in 2ED, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/242936-changeling-2-0-brainspew-2-contracts\"><b>as seen here.</b></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T10:31:30-07:00","id":681099,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Hey, it's Kismet! I really like all that homebrew you wrote and compiled on your site. </div> </div> </div>Yup, it's Kismet, and I'm so glad you enjoyed what's on the site! I've been madly tinkering a lot on Changeling lately (so inspired!) and need some feedback to catch anything I missed. Thank you so much for looking over the Contracts and saying something! I'm doing more work with changing whole clauses rather than rolls and details, so yeah, it helps. =)<br /> <br /> I'm actually doing this thus far without reference to 2E models; what I have seen from that direction hasn't been what I want for my own games. I won't be cutting clauses loose so that they're structured in tiers but the tiers don't mean anything. I won't be adding different effects to the same Contract for different Seemings. But that's just me.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Of note is how the Contracts' effects are determined in 2ED, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/242936-changeling-2-0-brainspew-2-contracts\"><b>as seen here.</b></a> </div> </div> </div>Are you referring to the Contract structure and variables per Seeming? I want to make sure I caught your whole meaning here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kismet's <a href=\"http://www.wod.kismetrose.com/\" target=\"_blank\">WOD</a> - <a href=\"http://www.dnd.kismetrose.com/\" target=\"_blank\">D&amp;D</a> - <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/BoundinDreams\" target=\"_blank\">C:tL</a> - <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheNamelessEmpire\" target=\"_blank\">M:tC</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/227-kismetrose","name":"KismetRose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T11:23:53-07:00","id":681176,"title":"","content":"Hey Kismet, Your contract changes look good. Also, your site really helped me when I wanted to run my own Changeling game. It probably wouldn't have gotten off the ground without you so, thanks. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7372-lady-gray","name":"Lady Gray","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7372_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T18:54:57-07:00","id":681653,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lady Gray</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/671315-kismet-s-changeling-contracts-revamp-part-i?p=681176#post681176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey Kismet, Your contract changes look good. Also, your site really helped me when I wanted to run my own Changeling game. It probably wouldn't have gotten off the ground without you so, thanks. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Lady Gray, thank you very much for looking them over! Thank you even more for letting me know that you found stuff that helped you get started with Changeling on my site. That makes my whole day. I've very much wanted to help bring new folks to the game because it is such a wonderful one. =D","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kismet's <a href=\"http://www.wod.kismetrose.com/\" target=\"_blank\">WOD</a> - <a href=\"http://www.dnd.kismetrose.com/\" target=\"_blank\">D&amp;D</a> - <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/BoundinDreams\" target=\"_blank\">C:tL</a> - <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheNamelessEmpire\" target=\"_blank\">M:tC</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","u